resentativeness":0.9447680115699768,"text_excerpt":"YES!!!! It is so great to be able to eat delicious beignets from Cafe Du Monde without the pigeons and smells of the Quarter! It isn't the original. And there's no substitution for the original, but you just don't always need all that. The atmosphere in city park is gorgeous! It's peaceful. There are oaks and moss and swans and grass. Warning: coming here doesn't mean you'll escape tourists!! As I was leaving, 4 tour busses pulled up and everyone unloaded and lined up at the register. So many people all at once. I would hate to get there in the middle of all that. There is no table service here, you've got to order inside. This doesn't seem like a problem to me. I still really enjoy it th..."},{"business_id":"5QefK7gbedeBiqsYJW54Bw","review_id":"LrE926RrHZQbgnS5wQXvnA","date":"2019-09-16T00:22:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9425456523895264,"text_excerpt":"Cafe Du Monde fits perfectly within the vibe of City Park. Situated near the Great Lawn, playgrounds, and the sculpture garden it is a perfect place to grab a snack. Not just a snack though but the classic beignets! I found these beignets to be the same as the ones in the Quarter. The fried sugary beignets were delicious and easy to scarf down. The building itself is lovely with plenty of sitting inside and outside. Unlike in the French Quarter, you order at the counter and they do accept credit cards! People will come to bus the table and I think it's still customary to leave a few dollars."},{"business_id":"5QefK7gbedeBiqsYJW54Bw","review_id":"sdY7CUIb5nqbUyQ3U9bwCw","date":"2021-09-03T01:24:23","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9386357069015503,"text_excerpt":"I've been to the original Cafe du Monde, but this location had such a great scenery. It was much cleaner and I just loved the scenery while we sat outside. The beignets were amazing as always, but they've added a dozen coffee and I was obsessed! I highly recommend this location."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"5QefK7gbedeBiqsYJW54Bw","photo_id":"UWOKu2zr0e2l2Mn0SUlmTA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/UWOKu2zr0e2l2Mn0SUlmTA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8510239124298096},{"business_id":"5QefK7gbedeBiqsYJW54Bw","photo_id":"wYY1wypWMUv6pmnzizsPBA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/wYY1wypWMUv6pmnzizsPBA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8378368616104126},{"business_id":"5QefK7gbedeBiqsYJW54Bw","photo_id":"7IGo7FuM0mYafEo4LDv78A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7IGo7FuM0mYafEo4LDv78A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8013864755630493},{"business_id":"5QefK7gbedeBiqsYJW54Bw","photo_id":"6Qd86jHNtWD2oUyScwx2nQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/6Qd86jHNtWD2oUyScwx2nQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7539862394332886},{"business_id":"5QefK7gbedeBiqsYJW54Bw","photo_id":"xqkg5INxPk4_ZWxIaO8tPQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/xqkg5INxPk4_ZWxIaO8tPQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7453184127807617}]},"notebook_case":null}
